Package: levyBridge
Title: Stochastic Bridges for Levy Degradation Processes
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Amedée Rytrace", "Tito", , "rytracetito5@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Christian", "Paroissin", , "christian.paroissin@univ-pau.fr", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Exact simulation of the bridges of Levy degradation processes
    (gamma, Wiener, inverse Gaussian, variance-gamma and Meixner
    processes) and resampling of trajectories observed at irregular
    inspection times onto a regular time grid, following the interpolation
    algorithm of Grall-Maes (2012) <doi:10.1177/1748006X12462522>. The
    reconstructed increments are the basis of goodness-of-fit tests.
